===Verb===
'''[[keep]] an [[eye]] [[out]]'''

# {{idiomatic}} To [[watch]] for, [[look]] for, or [[search]] for.
#: ''I think we're getting close, so '''keep an eye out''' for the next street.''

===Usage notes===
* Usually used with [[for]].

